      "pass": true,
      "note": "the oil gate keeps the flat cost per unobserved dragon: the reserve is a closed form, a low dragon's wake is one more event, a refuel a leg to the nearest field (a lookup of the index's regions around it) and a rest; the index is fixed by the world (a field per eight villages), not the dragons"
    },
